{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" is the adapter between RevenueCat’s SDK and Swidux’s purchase-agnostic paywall plugin. The plugin owns paywall state (presentation flags, current entitlement, async progress); this package translates RevenueCat’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo"},{"text":" into the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"text":" the plugin expects, and surfaces the live ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customerInfoStream"},{"text":" so entitlement changes propagate without polling.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two products ship together:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"text":" conformer) and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (a controllable preview \/ test conformer).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall(isPresented:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter(isPresented:)"},{"text":", drop-in SwiftUI view modifiers that wrap RevenueCatUI with platform-aware presentation, plus a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall(state:send:)"},{"text":" convenience that composes both.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The flow:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["View → store.send(.paywall(.request(reason:)))","  → PaywallPlugin sets isPresented = true","  → revenueCatPaywall observes the change, presents RevenueCatUI.PaywallView","  → user purchases → Purchases.shared.customerInfoStream yields a new CustomerInfo","  → RevenueCatPaywallService maps it to EntitlementSnapshot","  → PaywallPlugin reduces .customerInfoUpdated, sets isPro = true","  → store.paywall.isGateSatisfied flips, gated UI unlocks"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin and the adapter stay decoupled: the plugin doesn’t know about RevenueCat, and the adapter doesn’t know about your action tree."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Implements ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" against ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for drop-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presentation.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"role":"collection","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","symbolKind":"module"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Quickstart","anchor":"Quickstart","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxReve